; QWord: values out of range for typed constants and default parameters
; (qword values are unsigned), qword as a set element or array index type,
; case labels for a qword selector (ordered unsigned), integer literals
; beyond 2^64-1, and no qword in ISO mode.
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/qword/errors.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: errors.pas:3:16: error: value -1 is out of range for 'qword'
; CHECK: errors.pas:5:17: error: value 9223372036854775808 is out of range for 'int64'
; CHECK: errors.pas:7:17: error: set element type 'qword' has values outside 0..255; use a subrange
; CHECK: errors.pas:8:16: error: array index type 'qword' is too large; use a subrange such as 1..100
; CHECK: errors.pas:11:24: error: value -2 is out of range for 'qword'
; CHECK: errors.pas:16:5: error: case label is outside the range of type 'qword'
; CHECK: errors.pas:17:5: error: case label range is empty
; CHECK: errors.pas:19:5: error: duplicate case label value 9223372036854775808
; CHECK: errors.pas:18:5: note: previous case label is here
; CHECK-NOT: error:

; RUN: not %p3 --mode=tp -c %S/Inputs/qword/toobig.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=BIG %s
; BIG: toobig.pas:4:12: error: integer literal is too large
; BIG-NOT: error:

; RUN: not %p3 -c %S/Inputs/qword/iso.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=ISO %s
; ISO: iso.pas:2:8: error: unknown type name 'qword'
